  "description": "The classic degenerative trio took to Stockholm, for yet another rinse and repeat of run, walk, coffee, shop, dinner, drink heavily. Except we did mix it up a little this time with the Avicii Experience. Probably the most off-script activity we've done on a trio holiday in a while. Also, why the damn hell to I always double down on the kebab on the final night. It's a recipe for disaster. Never mind the quadrupling down on the drinks.",
